---
// Why training a big model takes so long, as a receipt with the same look as GrowthReceipt. The dials
// line is the punch: part 1's toy has 9, the bean line has 2, and the biggest Llama 3.1 model has about
// 405 billion, written out in full in big type. Rows under it are for the real model only, from Meta's
// "The Llama 3 Herd of Models" paper and the Llama 3.1 announcement (405B parameters, 15.6T pre-training
// tokens, up to 16K chips). The paper gives no total elapsed time, so the time row says weeks to months.
// No chip brand here; that belongs to part 5. Static HTML, no JavaScript.
---
<figure class="trc panel bleed">
  <div class="trc-receipt">
    <p class="trc-head">TRAINING RECEIPT</p>
    <p class="trc-sec">Dials</p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>part 1's toy</span><i></i><b>9</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>this post's bean line</span><i></i><b>2</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>Meta's biggest Llama 3.1</span></p>
    <p class="trc-big"><small>about</small> 405,000,000,000</p>
    <p class="trc-sec">The real one only</p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>tokens read</span><i></i><b>over 15 trillion</b></p>
    <p class="trc-note">A token is a word piece, from part 1.</p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>chips</span><i></i><b>about 16,000</b></p>
    <p class="trc-row"><span>time</span><i></i><b>weeks to months</b></p>
    <p class="trc-total"><span>Total</span>trillions of guesses, each batch nudging billions of dials</p>
    <svg class="trc-tear" viewBox="0 0 200 10" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 0 L0 4 L10 10 L20 4 L30 10 L40 4 L50 10 L60 4 L70 10 L80 4 L90 10 L100 4 L110 10 L120 4 L130 10 L140 4 L150 10 L160 4 L170 10 L180 4 L190 10 L200 4 L200 0 Z" /></svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Real figures from Meta's Llama 3 paper and its Llama 3.1 announcement, for the biggest Llama 3.1 model. The toy and bean numbers come from this series.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .trc p { margin: 0; }
  .trc-receipt { position: relative; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 10px; background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0; padding: 18px 18px 16px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .trc-head { font: 700 1.05rem/1.2 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; text-align: center; padding-bottom: 10px !important; margin-bottom: 6px !important; border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--line); }
  .trc-sec { font: 700 0.72rem/1.3 Inter, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin: 12px 0 2px !important; }
  .trc-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.9; }
  .trc-row i { flex: 1; border-bottom: 2px dotted var(--muted); opacity: .6; transform: translateY(-4px); min-width: 12px; }
  .trc-row b, .trc-row span { white-space: nowrap; }
  .trc-big { font: 700 clamp(1.45rem, 7.4vw, 2.7rem)/1.1 "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; color: var(--teal); text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; margin: 2px 0 4px !important; }
  .trc-big small { display: block; font: 600 0.85rem/1.3 ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; color: var(--muted); }
  .trc-note { font: 500 0.85rem/1.3 Inter, sans-serif; color: var(--violet); margin-bottom: 2px !important; }
  .trc-total { margin-top: 12px !important; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 2px dashed var(--line); font: 700 1.2rem/1.35 "Space Grotesk", sans-serif; display: grid; gap: 2px; }
  .trc-total span { font: 700 0.72rem/1.3 Inter, sans-serif; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  .trc-tear { position: absolute; left: -1px; bottom: -10px; width: calc(100% + 2px); height: 10px; }
  .trc-tear path { fill: var(--bg-2); stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; }
</style>
